[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to a YAML Deserialization vulnerability. This vulnerability arises from the use of the `yaml.load()` function without specifying a `Loader`. When `yaml.load()` is used without a specific Loader, it defaults to `yaml.FullLoader` which can execute arbitrary Python code. If the YAML content is untrusted and comes from an external source, an attacker could craft malicious YAML input that, when loaded, executes arbitrary code on the server, leading to a complete system compromise.

